              "type": "text",
              "text": "## Canonical User Intent (already disambiguated by LLM)\r\nCheck if the variable %pr.Function.Name% equals the string 'CreateDataSource' to conditionally execute subsequent steps\n## functions available starts ##\n{\"Description\":\"if statement for the user intent. Example 1:'if %isValid% is true then call SomeGoal, else call OtherGoal', this condition would return true if %isValid% is true and call a goals on either conditions. Example 2:'if %address% is empty then', this would check if the %address% variable is empty and return true if it is, else false. Use when checking if file or directory exists. Prefer predefined methods in this module over SimpleCondition and CompoundCondition. \\nif statement can throw an error, e.g. `if %isValid% is false, then throw error 'Not valid'`\\n\\n\",\"ExampleInformation\":\"Examples with methods first define an example plang code and then(=>) how it is mapped to parameters\",\"Methods\":[{\"MethodName\":\"FileExists\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"filePathOrVariableName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"IsBase64\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"content\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"DirectoryExists\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"dirPathOrVariableName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Modules.ThrowErrorModule.ErrorInfo\",\"Name\":\"throwErrorOnFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}],\"ReturnValue\":{\"Type\":\"System.Object\"},\"ReturnRequired\":false},{\"MethodName\":\"HasAccessToPath\",\"Parameters\":[{\"Type\":\"System.String\",\"Name\":\"dirOrFilePathOrVariableName\",\"IsRequired\":true},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfTrue\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false},{\"Type\":\"PLang.Models.GoalToCallInfo\",\"Name\":\"goalToCallIfFalse\",\"Description\":\"(see Type information in SupportingObjects)\",\"IsRequired\":false}